  },
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "fe26a33e-9f64-4725-954d-dc75d53f5114",
      "udi": "umb://element/f50ad02b9c9a4fad8ff914ea42c5175b"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": "",
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "1",
      "contentTypeKey": "4ac6dfe6-3e77-4ebb-b1d7-f73ee48847f4",
      "heading": "Programs for Students",
      "highlightParagraph": "Our practices are more than just techniques-they are tools that help students to navigate complexities with calmness, focus, and a deeper sense of purpose.",
      "iconImage": [],
      "iconImageBigger": "0",
      "iconImageCaption": "",
      "iconImageOnRight": "0",
      "paragraph": {
        "markup": "<p>University life is a whirlwind of opportunities, challenges, and constant change. With so much happening, it’s easy to feel overwhelmed or disconnected.</p>\n<p>What if you could discover a way to not only thrive academically, but also achieve peace, clarity, and emotional resilience in the process?</p>\n<h3>Here’s what BEHF brings to students:</h3>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/aab580134bab4874a71269a3ec57fd18"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": "",
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "1",
      "contentTypeKey": "4ac6dfe6-3e77-4ebb-b1d7-f73ee48847f4",
      "heading": "Stress-Free Success",
      "highlightParagraph": "",
      "iconImage": [
        {
          "key": "bdd86d42-bd8c-468e-b7b4-43af4ff4cc6a",
          "mediaKey": "8e2801fe-ce5d-405f-b83b-c013dff4404e"
        }
      ],
      "iconImageBigger": "0",
      "iconImageCaption": "",
      "iconImageOnRight": "0",
      "paragraph": {
        "markup": "<p>Learn practical techniques to manage stress and stay calm, so you approach exams, and life with calmness and confidence.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/7e8854ff7d6d43cc8285b80d5bccaef5"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": "",
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "1",
      "contentTypeKey": "4ac6dfe6-3e77-4ebb-b1d7-f73ee48847f4",
      "heading": "Enhanced Focus and Concentration",
      "highlightParagraph": "",
      "iconImage": [
        {
          "key": "dafee4f1-571a-447e-b9c3-27ca69886b9d",
          "mediaKey": "fdae9ec5-c707-4ecd-8b7d-cc578e6f5f12"
        }
      ],
      "iconImageBigger": "0",
      "iconImageCaption": "",
      "iconImageOnRight": "0",
      "paragraph": {
        "markup": "<p>Harness the power of mindfulness to improve the academic performance and stay present in the moment.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/3cb46f1c3e00499987cbacce9209d0ef"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": "",
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "0.250",
      "contentTypeKey": "4ac6dfe6-3e77-4ebb-b1d7-f73ee48847f4",
      "heading": "Promote Emotional Well-Being",
      "highlightParagraph": "",
      "iconImage": [
        {
          "key": "dc32b219-f51f-4fc8-8556-5426d2411491",
          "mediaKey": "16206078-8f02-4eec-8ece-7dad8507ed22"
        }
      ],
      "iconImageBigger": "0",
      "iconImageCaption": "",
      "iconImageOnRight": "0",
      "paragraph": {
        "markup": "<p>Develop emotional strength, enhance your mental well-being, and cultivate a positive mindset.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/a25d22458151479dace8be11ec0e95d2"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": "",
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "1",
      "contentTypeKey": "4ac6dfe6-3e77-4ebb-b1d7-f73ee48847f4",
      "heading": "Find Purpose and Clarity",
      "highlightParagraph": "",
      "iconImage": [
        {
          "key": "e7f5d0da-bd85-4389-ab4f-2d126b4fff09",
          "mediaKey": "713144f0-02a2-4ae7-b38e-bf87ccce500e"
        }
      ],
      "iconImageBigger": "0",
      "iconImageCaption": "",
      "iconImageOnRight": "0",
      "paragraph": {
        "markup": "<p>Explore the spiritual side and find purpose &amp; clarity with your core values by understanding the life beyond.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/bc3ba7380ad14b8db98a66f4b6cda30e"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "fe26a33e-9f64-4725-954d-dc75d53f5114",
      "udi": "umb://element/6400c7c2303246aeaccf5495ae2c2fec"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": "",
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "1",
      "contentTypeKey": "4ac6dfe6-3e77-4ebb-b1d7-f73ee48847f4",
      "heading": "",
      "highlightParagraph": "Our workshops are tailored to meet the needs of university students, providing accessible and flexible sessions that fit into your busy schedule. Whether you are new to meditation or looking to deepen your practice, BEHF is here to guide you in every step.",
      "iconImage": [
        {
          "key": "ab854e01-6e73-4738-b5f1-0169b91a78d9",
          "mediaKey": "f975c635-b792-4c78-b77c-8d7d8bc78cd8"
        }
      ],
      "iconImageBigger": "1",
      "iconImageCaption": "",
      "iconImageOnRight": "0",
      "paragraph": {
        "markup": "<p>We look forward to supporting the individual in experiencing the <strong>balanced</strong>, <strong>successful</strong>, <strong>fulfilling</strong>, <strong>and joyous life</strong>.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/a54b87bfd2e74bf3afbcaeca2a3e6cc0"
    }
  ],
